(Section 2: High-Dimensional Dense Vector Embeddings) Tj T*
(We evaluate text-embedding-004 generating 768-dimensional normalized unit vectors.) Tj T*
(Cosine similarity measures the orientation between query vectors and document chunk vectors.) Tj T*
(When combined with lexical keyword weighting \(BM25-lite bonus of 0.15\), retrieval precision) Tj T*
(increases by 14.3% compared to pure dense search alone.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Key Finding on Page 2:) Tj T*
(The hybrid retrieval strategy eliminates false positive matches on technical acronyms.) Tj T*
(Total indexing latency per 100-page document remains under 4.2 seconds.) Tj T*
ET
