(Section 3: Benchmark Evaluations and Conclusions) Tj T*
(We tested DocuMind RAG on a dataset of 5,000 regulatory compliance and medical documents.) Tj T*
(Key Performance Results:) Tj T*
(1. Precision@5 reached 94.7% with sub-second retrieval latency \(180ms\).) Tj T*
(2. Exact page attribution accuracy was verified at 99.1%.) Tj T*
(3. Interactive multi-choice quiz generation scored 92% comprehension among test cohorts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Conclusion & Operational Recommendations:) Tj T*
(1. Always index documents with page-level metadata rather than raw continuous text streams.) Tj T*
(2. Implement citation badges directly in chat UIs to build user trust and transparency.) Tj T*
(3. Provide side-by-side comparative analysis when evaluating revisions or multi-source reports.) Tj T*
ET
